r airliner bears down aggressively forward, its glossy white fuselage scuffed with soot and turbulent wind marks. Positioned directly in the absolute centre foreground of the frame, Spider-Man stands braced in an extreme low athletic stance, his back wedged deep into the crushed metal of the aircraft's nosecone. Directly behind his straining back, the blunt aluminum radome is dramatically crumpled and caved inward into a deep concave crater that conforms tightly to the violent contour of his spine and shoulder blades. Around the crushing impact point, the aircraft's painted metal skin is heavily buckled with jagged radiating stress creases, spiderwebbed enamel cracks, and popped rivets bursting loose under immense pressure. Facing directly toward the camera with resolute strain, his muscular frame is pushed to its absolute physical limits in a deliberate homage to the iconic train-stopping hero stance. His iconic red and blue suit features tactile raised charcoal webbing patterns over textured hexagonal micro-mesh fabric, with several frayed tears across the torso and shoulders revealing scratched, grimy skin beneath. His masked head is tilted slightly downward with white expressive triangular eye lenses angled inward in fierce concentration, showing visible dust smears and sweat trickling around the seam edges. Both of his arms are outstretched fully horizontally toward opposite sides of the frame, his gloved fingers clenching thick clusters of fibrous white spider silk with superhuman grip. Extending outward from his clenched hands toward the far left and far right edges of the frame, dozens of dense, translucent web lines stretch razor-taut across the runway, vibrating violently with a few overburdened outer strands audibly snapping and whipping back into wispy, fraying curls under the catastrophic tension. On the outer flanks of the frame, the far ends of the silk strands anchor deeply into heavy concrete runway barriers and metal light stanchions, wrenching and bending the steel supports inward. Flanking the aircraft on either side in the midground, the massive twin turbofan jet engines belch intense heat shimmer and scattered sparks as reverse thrusters struggle to engage. Across the lower third of the frame, his braced boots have plowed two deep, violently gouged trenches directly into the pulverized black asphalt, churning up smoking rubble and jagged chunks of displaced tarmac that trail forward. In the lower-left and lower-right corners, heavy showers of bright orange friction sparks spray outward from the trenching soles alongside smoking rubber residue. Along the bottom edge, faded yellow runway centerline markings and small embedded recessed taxiway lights are partially obscured by swirling clouds of white friction smoke, chipped metal fragments, and pulverized dust. Scattered across the outer margins of the runway, loose gravel and dislodged runway marker cones tumble through the violent air wake created by the decelerating jetliner. Along the visible upper-left flank of the aircraft fuselage, blurred blue painted livery stripes and faint indistinct tail numbers recede into the shallow atmospheric depth of field. The lighting is harsh and high-contrast, driven by the blazing white landing lights of the aircraft casting intense rim light along Spider-Man's silhouette, while fiery ground sparks cast warm amber highlights against his suit. The overall composition uses a symmetrical, high-octane cinematic perspective that pits human resilience against mechanical fury, delivering an overwhelming sense of kinetic deceleration and epic tension."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Prompt", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [390, 450], "pos": [310, 0], "id": 478, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 5}, {"o